<h4>PSU Control - Tapo</h4>
<form class="form-horizontal" onsubmit="return false;">
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Tapo email</label>
        <div class="controls"><input type="text" class="input-xlarge" data-bind="value: settings.username"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Tapo password</label>
        <div class="controls"><input type="password" class="input-xlarge" data-bind="value: settings.password"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">Plug IP address</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="text" class="input-medium" placeholder="192.168.1.50" data-bind="value: settings.host">
            <button class="btn" data-bind="click: discover, enable: !scanning()">
                <i class="fas fa-search" data-bind="css: {'fa-spin fa-spinner': scanning}"></i> Auto-detect
            </button>
            <span class="help-block" data-bind="text: message"></span>
            <ul class="unstyled" data-bind="foreach: devices">
                <li><a href="#" data-bind="click: $parent.pick">
                    <span data-bind="text: alias"></span> (<span data-bind="text: model"></span>) - <span data-bind="text: host"></span>
                </a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">Enable <b>Third-Party Compatibility</b> in the Tapo app (Me &gt; Third-Party Services).
        Then in PSU Control settings pick <b>psucontrol_tapo</b> as the Switching and Sensing plugin.</p>
</form>
